/ Multiple-choice question — skin-aware (Plan 01, Phase 2).
/ KEEP: .question-button / .multiple-choice-button + id="response-<id>" (multiple_choice_question.js
/ delegates clicks); #nextButton / .next-button / .tj-invisible (reload to advance). The JS appends
/ the fa-check / fa-times reveal icon; .correct-answer / .incorrect-answer drive the reskinned reveal.
.tjs-question
  - if @question.topic.present?
    .tjs-question__pill
      = render 'shared/skin/pill', text: @question.topic.name, color: subject_neon(@quiz.subject)
  .tjs-question__text ==@question.question_text
  .tjs-answers
    - answers = @question.answers.shuffle
    - answers.each_with_index do |a, i|
      button.tjs-card.tjs-tile.tjs-answer.question-button.multiple-choice-button id="response-#{a.id}"
        span.tjs-answer__badge = ('A'.ord + i).chr
        span.tjs-answer__text = a.text
  / answer-effect mount — Phase 4 renders the equipped answer-effect burst here on a correct answer
  .tjs-quiz__fx data-quiz-target='answerFx' aria-hidden='true'
  = render 'quizzes/answer_feedback'
  button.tjs-btn.tjs-btn--primary.tjs-quiz__next.next-button.tj-invisible#nextButton onclick='location.reload()' Next Question
